      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T22:48:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about:\n\n`mShouldUpdateSuspensions \u003d mIsColdStartupAfterReboot`\n\nDoes the unlock state check here help us?",
      "revId": "4a8aca4a7f14de9c49c123ef6c96815f26483e6e",
      "serverId": "35266860-6252-469c-a67d-185064479fc0"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "88570f48_90125660",
        "filename": "src/com/android/launcher3/Launcher.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 442,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T22:50:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After looking at `src/com/android/launcher3/util/LockedUserState.kt`, maybe `isUserUnlocked` would be a better fit if needed?",
      "parentUuid": "9a237b57_7ca9203c",
      "revId": "4a8aca4a7f14de9c49c123ef6c96815f26483e6e",
      "serverId": "35266860-6252-469c-a67d-185064479fc0"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e6a053d3_d7bd6790",
        "filename": "src/com/android/launcher3/Launcher.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 442,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000062
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T22:53:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought about using `mIsColdStartupAfterReboot`, but I couldn\u0027t come up with a good reason and was having some trouble understanding the purpose behind it.\n\nIf judging by the name of that variable alone - we don\u0027t currently support updating Launcher3 out-of-band, but if we ever did, then resource IDs could be a problem when the app gets updated, and it would be nice for the suspension updates to take effect in that case, too, not just after a cold reboot.\n\nDo you think checking for unlock would protect us from anything? I don\u0027t see how... We also already don\u0027t really react until we get a list of apps and we have exception handling all over the place.",
      "parentUuid": "88570f48_90125660",
      "revId": "4a8aca4a7f14de9c49c123ef6c96815f26483e6e",
      "serverId": "35266860-6252-469c-a67d-185064479fc0"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
