      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T22:57:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Do you think checking for unlock would protect us from anything? I don\u0027t see how... We also already don\u0027t really react until we get a list of apps and we have exception handling all over the place.\n\nProtect no, I was more thinking if it\u0027d be useful that\u0027s all. But my test was on a device with a pin and it worked fine on that anyways, and thus simple is probably better than unless complexity is needed.",
      "parentUuid": "e6a053d3_d7bd6790",
      "revId": "4a8aca4a7f14de9c49c123ef6c96815f26483e6e",
